gh issue comment 116 -b "Implemented Solution: Migrated the booking saga to a secure Firestore transaction in \`slotsService.ts\` (\`executeBooking\`), which guarantees atomicity by checking slot availability and creating the booking atomically using a deterministic booking ID. Fixed in PR #169."
